p can be brilliant crime-solvers.\",\"starring\":\"Hugh Jackman, Nicholas Braun, Nicholas Galitzine\",\"directedBy\":\"Kyle Balda\",\"producedBy\":\"Tim Bevan, Eric Fellner, Lindsay Doran\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":109,\"genre\":\"Mystery\",\"allGenres\":\"Mystery, Comedy, Drama\",\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"kXUZWOzgZN8\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-08\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-05-02\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":110.849,\"tmdbId\":\"1301421\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"422241\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Sheep Detectives, The [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"418972\",\"time\":\"2026-05-02T11:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":54,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"418973\",\"time\":\"2026-05-02T14:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":24,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":36,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"418974\",\"time\":\"2026-05-03T12:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":34,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":26,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"418975\",\"time\":\"2026-05-03T15:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":51,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":9,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"418976\",\"time\":\"2026-05-04T09:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":10,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":91,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"418977\",\"time\":\"2026-05-04T16:10:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":54,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":6,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"432615\",\"time\":\"2026-05-08T14:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":98,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"418978\",\"time\":\"2026-05-08T17:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":29,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":72,\"displa