":\"447044\",\"time\":\"2026-06-14T10:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"447427\",\"time\":\"2026-06-17T16:25:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":57,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"449680\",\"time\":\"2026-06-20T10:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"449783\",\"time\":\"2026-06-24T15:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":9,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":92,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"450953\",\"time\":\"2026-07-25T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"450954\",\"time\":\"2026-07-26T13:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"kids-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"31214\",\"name\":\"Bring Your Own Baby Comedy Club\",\"showingStatus\":\"Has Played\",\"urlSlug\":\"bring-your-own-baby-comedy-club\",\"posterImage\":\"hjhgts1l8870cv04to1o8rgfhqpb\",\"bannerImage\":\"9ywkwzecy92jnf8xfr7xhpsqwtue\",\"synopsis\":\"WINNER: Best bring-along Baby Event (HOOP Awards)\\nWINNER: Comedy Club of the Year 2024 (Innovation and Excellence Awards)\\nWINNER: Best Mental Health Boost for New Parents 2022 (UK Enterprise Awards)\\nWINNER: Best Comedy Event for Families 2023 (Prestige Awards)\\nNOMINATED: Feed With Confidence Award 2018\\n\\n“Yaaaas! This is the maternity leave I have dreamed of!” – Michelle, BYOB Guest\\n\\n“Bring Your Own Baby Comedy has transformed parental leave” – i paper\\n\\u2028\\nJoin us for an afternoon of hilarious comedy, where you can relax and have a good laugh at the best comedians in the UK, without needing childcare! There’s buggy parking, baby changing so that you can take some time for yourself and just be entertained. The bar is fully stocked, whether you fancy a cuppa or even something a bit stronger (G\\u0026T anyone?). If you need to whip out a bum (the baby’s please!), a boob or a bottle, then please feel free… and our comics won’t mind being heckled by our younger guests!*\\n\\nEach show features two brilliant comedians plus a compere, and the whole show will last approx. 75 minutes including an interval.\\n\\n*Please note that we have a 15-month age limit for our little laughers, as our comedians will be performing their usual grown-up jokes!\\n\\n*Please note that buggies cannot be brought into the performance space with you so please bring a sling if your baby would like to relax during the show\\n* If you are coming with twins or have any additional needs, please contact our friendly team at info@byobcomedy.com\",\"starring\":null,\"directedBy\":null,\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":120,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-09\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2025-12-09\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":null,\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"420\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"362962\",\"time\":\"2025-12-09T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":73,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":52,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"362963\",\"time\":\"2026-02-10T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":46,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":79,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394890\",\"time\":\"2026-04-21T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":55,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":70,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394891\",\"time\":\"2026-06-09T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":21,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":104,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394892\",\"time\":\"2026-09-15T10:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394893\",\"time\":\"2026-10-27T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394894\",\"time\":\"2026-12-08T11:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free baby-friendly\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38588\",\"name\":\"Interstellar\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"interstellar\",\"posterImage\":\"m5xdqu9rjyjenf01wgadzqurhwhf\",\"bannerImage\":\"dlg5utaziqeelvvrdsoz683gxebs\",\"synopsis\":\"With our time on Earth coming to an end, a team of explorers undertakes the most important mission in human history: traveling beyond this galaxy to discover whether mankind has a future among the stars.\\n\",\"starring\":\"Matthew McConaughey, Anne Hathaway, Michael Caine\",\"directedBy\":\"Christopher Nolan\",\"producedBy\":\"Christopher Nolan, Emma Thomas, Lynda Obst\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":169,\"genre\":\"Adventure\",\"allGenres\":\"Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"zSWdZVtXT7E\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2014-11-05\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-12\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":61.1834,\"tmdbId\":\"157336\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"145166\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Interstellar (2D) [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"447982\",\"time\":\"2026-07-12T15:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":7,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":94,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"447983\",\"time\":\"2026-07-13T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":6,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":95,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38561\",\"name\":\"Fifth Birthday Party: Cinema Paradiso\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"fifth-birthday-party-cinema-paradiso\",\"posterImage\":\"bt0tc8lzrryknblqj4syqq395igl\",\"bannerImage\":\"g3uwvs8lzsa36cicmx8gg1ah20u8\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eWe're throwing a party to celebrate the cinema's fifth anniversary since opening and we'd love you to join us. We've handpicked four films to highlight what it is we do best. Tickets include a complimentary prosecco or juice, and there will be complimentary jazz from our house musicians; stalls from our sponsors and partners; and exciting announcements where you can be the first to find out what's coming up at the cinema later in the year.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe first 100 people to arrive will even get their hands on a treat-laden Chiswick Cinema tote bag.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAndrea Carnevali will introduce this screening as party of our popular Film Club strand.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003eAbout the film:\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eA filmmaker recalls his childhood when falling in love with the pictures at the cinema of his home village and forms a deep friendship with the cinema's projectionist.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Philippe Noiret, Jacques Perrin, Marco Leonardi, Salvatore Cascio\",\"directedBy\":\"Giuseppe Tornatore\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":123,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JMyVSD6OvO8\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"139723\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Fifth Estate, The (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"447664\",\"time\":\"2026-07-14T18:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":98,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":3,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"intro ad-free andreas-film-club\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38754\",\"name\":\"Fifth Birthday Party: The Summer Book [PREVIEW]\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"fifth-birthday-party-the-summer-book\",\"posterImage\":\"3sbb5ddhkuj9m7jqxr1pgxlxmyxn\",\"bannerImage\":\"4yr50hcf4pwwepqtaycn8wjj6elm\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eWe're throwing a party to celebrate the cinema's fifth anniversary since opening and we'd love you to join us. We've handpicked four films to highlight what it is we do best. Tickets include a complimentary prosecco or juice, and there will be complimentary jazz from our house musicians; stalls from our sponsors and partners; and exciting announcements where you can be the first to find out what's coming up at the cinema later in the year.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe first 100 people to arrive will even get their hands on a treat-laden Chiswick Cinema tote bag.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAbout the film:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eFollows the inspirational tale of a young girl and her grandmother spending a summer on a small, uninhabited island in the Gulf of Finland.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Glenn Close, Anders Danielsen Lie, Ingvar Sigurdsson\",\"directedBy\":\"Charlie McDowell\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":95,\"genre\":null,\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"PG\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"tDYcCHgDdfI\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"139723\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Fifth Estate, The (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"449513\",\"time\":\"2026-07-14T18:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":26,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":34,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"intro ad-free\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"38802\",\"name\":\"Fifth Birthday Party: La La Land\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"fifth-birthday-party-la-la-land\",\"posterImage\":\"4m3bs9r3nhgiiha5gqpnv67rjkmr\",\"bannerImage\":\"l26w3c7zj9xy1slotx85esgr2ftg\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eWe're throwing a party to celebrate the cinema's fifth anniversary since opening and we'd love you to join us. We've handpicked four films to highlight what it is we do best. Tickets include a complimentary prosecco or juice, and there will be complimentary jazz from our house musicians; stalls from our sponsors and partners; and exciting announcements where you can be the first to find out what's coming up at the cinema later in the year.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eThe first 100 people to arrive will even get their hands on a treat-laden Chiswick Cinema tote bag.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAbout the film:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eMia, an aspiring actress, serves lattes to movie stars in between auditions and Sebastian, a jazz musician, scrapes by playing cocktail party gigs in dingy bars, but as success mounts they are faced with decisions that begin to fray the fragile fabric of their love affair, and the dreams they worked so hard to maintain in each other threaten to rip them apart.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Ryan Gosling, Emma Stone, John Legend, Rosemarie DeWitt, Finn Wittrock, J. K. Simmons\",\"directedBy\":\"Damien Chazelle\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":128,\"genre\":\"Musical\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"0pdqf4P9MB8\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"139723\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Fifth Estate, The (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"450979\",\"time\":\"2026-07-14T19:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":31,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":94,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"intro ad-free\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"35364\",\"name\":\"Fifth Birthday Party: They Never Slept + Panel\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"they-never-slept\",\"posterImage\":\"ttrlgifxtfq4hbqqrru0ktib12dy\",\"bannerImage\":\"caz125p0de2jfxx67t4tq0xiuy6h\",\"synopsis\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eMargy Kinmonth will host a Q\\u0026amp;A prior to the film with theatre director Richard Eyre, actor James Fleet and the film's director Udayan Prasad. Guests are TBC due to filming commitments.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eWe're throwing a party to celebrate the cinema's fifth anniversary since opening and we'd love you to join us. We've handpicked four films to highlight what it is we do best. Tickets include a complimentary prosecco or juice, and there will be complimentary jazz from our house musicians; stalls from our sponsors and partners; and exciting announcements where you can be the first to find out what's coming up at the cinema later in the year.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eThe first 100 people to arrive will even get their hands on a treat-laden Chiswick Cinema tote bag.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAbout Margy Kinmonth:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size: 14px;\\\"\\u003eAn award winning film director, writer and producer, her theatrical documentaries include “War Paint - Women at War” following female war artists in contemporary conflict zones. “Eric Ravilious - Drawn to War” tells the tragic story of official war artist killed on active service in WW2 (Foxtrot Films). Kinmonth\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/span\\u003ewon the BAFTA Best Documentary Series for series “Naked Hollywood” (BBC). My authored film “ The Strange World of Barry Who?” (BBC) won Royal Television Society Best Arts Film Award.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAbout the film:\\u003c/div\\u003eWhen plucky Corporal Pru Merriman reports to her superiors, she is catapulted into the murky world of the French Resistance.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eAbout the season:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eGRAY MATTERS: The Films of Simon Gray\\n\\\"It is a curious thing, being alive... It's like living in a room with a clock that ticks the wrong time, but there's no one around to tell you.\\n\\nThe Chiswick Cinema are delighted to host this exclusive season celebrating the career of Simon Gray.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;About SIMON GRAY:\\nSimon Gray (1936 - 2008) was a British playwright, screenwriter, and novelist, best known for his deep and witty explorations of the human condition. His darkly comedic work often featured academic, middle-class characters caught in emotional or intellectual crisis, told with razor sharp dialogue. His ability to balance humour with existential despair has earned him a lasting place in theatre. His contemporary Harold Pinter, directed several of his plays.\\n\\nGray wrote novels, screenplays and candid memoirs that reflected on his work, health, smoking and depression. His style has a dryly intelligent rigor, with brilliant wit, self-deprecation and philosophic honesty often going hand in hand. Disillusionment, achievement, and the despair in everyday entrapments are a throughline to the psychologically complex texts.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Edward Fox, Emily Morgan, James Fleet, Patricia Lawrence, François Chaumette, Elaine Ford, Maria Laborit, Alison Fielding, Maurice Risch, Harriet Walter, Pete Postlethwaite, Imelda Staunton, Patrick Fierry, Yvette Petit\",\"directedBy\":\"Udayan Prasad\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":75,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"18\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":null,\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-14\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-14\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"7920\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Fifth element, the (2D) [PG]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"405090\",\"time\":\"2026-07-14T19:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":71,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":30,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"qa ad-free\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"34890\",\"name\":\"No Country For Old Men\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"no-country-for-old-men\",\"posterImage\":\"d90wln0o16cq7rbia9gv0ecd8ove\",\"bannerImage\":\"6ackfm9v7wy8unxayqkbhpusw0uq\",\"synopsis\":\"While out hunting, Llewelyn Moss (Josh Brolin) finds the grisly aftermath of a drug deal. Though he knows better, he cannot resist the cash left behind and takes it with him. The hunter becomes the hunted when a merciless killer named Chigurh (Javier Bardem) picks up his trail. Also looking for Moss is Sheriff Bell (Tommy Lee Jones), an aging lawman who reflects on a changing world and a dark secret of his own, as he tries to find and protect Moss.\",\"starring\":\"Tommy Lee Jones, Javier Bardem, Josh Brolin, Woody Harrelson, Kelly Macdonald\",\"directedBy\":\"Joel Coen, Ethan Coen\",\"producedBy\":null,\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":122,\"genre\":\"Thriller\",\"allGenres\":null,\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=38A__WT3-o0\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-16\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-16\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":null,\"tmdbId\":null,\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"25975\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"No Country For Old Men (2D) [15]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"419\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"399681\",\"time\":\"2026-07-16T18:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":13,\"screenId\":\"440\",\"seatsRemaining\":88,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser ad-free books-on-film\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"37992\",\"name\":\"The Odyssey\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-odyssey\",\"posterImage\":\"h905ddoz5u4het8qovdl98wci2nj\",\"bannerImage\":\"4u7i64jcgnxby6inwml55s44s22o\",\"synopsis\":\"Christopher Nolan’s next film, The Odyssey, is a mythic action epic shot across the world using brand new IMAX® film technology. The film brings Homer’s foundational saga to IMAX® film screens for the first time and opens in cinemas everywhere on July 17, 2026.\",\"starring\":\"Matt Damon, Tom Holland, Anne Hathaway\",\"directedBy\":\"Christopher Nolan\",\"producedBy\":\"Christopher Nolan, Emma Thomas\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":173,\"genre\":\"Adventure\",\"allGenres\":\"Adventure, Drama, Fantasy\",\"rating\":\"15\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"Sk6LZrA2JSQ\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-17\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-17\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":106.61,\"tmdbId\":\"1368337\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"412037\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"ODYSSEY, THE [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"446163\",\"time\":\"2026-07-17T11:25:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":11,\"screenId\":\"439