 Days In China\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"wham-10-days-in-china\",\"posterImage\":\"tlhvn81pwi5rsq1thxxyvpqfn4c9\",\"bannerImage\":\"g8509zeoygtf7adfc3p84yf3d9c5\",\"synopsis\":\"In 1985, WHAM! made history as the first Western pop act to perform in communist China. GeorgeMichael and Andrew Ridgeley’s concerts in Beijing and Guangzhou were a cultural milestone – Eastmeets West, music meets politics. Now, newly restored footage reveals the untold story of the iconictour that helped launch WHAM! to global superstardom.\",\"starring\":\"George Michael, Andrew Ridgeley\",\"directedBy\":\"Mike Christie\",\"producedBy\":\"\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":90,\"genre\":\"Music\",\"allGenres\":\"Music, Documentary\",\"rating\":\"TBC\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"P7oAaJqqv8w\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-28\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-28\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":0.9846,\"tmdbId\":\"1715914\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"517715\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"Lrc wham! 10 days in china [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"454906\",\"time\":\"2026-07-28T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":56,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"454907\",\"time\":\"2026-07-30T19:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":5,\"screenId\":\"442\",\"seatsRemaining\":55,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser event-cinema\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"37984\",\"name\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"showingStatus\":\"On Sale\",\"urlSlug\":\"spider-man-brand-new-day\",\"posterImage\":\"zh9uvbqsbqa4nt9u9515h92zup2r\",\"bannerImage\":\"r70go48ge159n2dgjj87m6y50j7v\",\"synopsis\":\"It's a BRAND NEW DAY for Peter Parker.\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003eFighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn’t remember him -- and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him -- sparks a change in Peter he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"starring\":\"Tom Holland, Zendaya, Sadie Sink\",\"directedBy\":\"Destin Daniel Cretton\",\"producedBy\":\"Kevin Feige, Amy Pascal, Rachel O'Connor, Avi Arad\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":144,\"genre\":\"Science Fiction\",\"allGenres\":\"Science Fiction, Action, Adventure\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"Q27BvUipKn8\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-31\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-07-30\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":88.6793,\"tmdbId\":\"969681\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"437687\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"SPIDER-MAN: BRAND NEW DAY [Unknown]\",\"siteId\":\"170\",\"titleClassId\":\"410\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"448584\",\"time\":\"2026-07-29T16:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448585\",\"time\":\"2026-07-29T19:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":101,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448586\",\"time\":\"2026-07-30T15:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":9,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":92,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448587\",\"time\":\"2026-07-30T18:45:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"seatsRemaining\":81,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448591\",\"time\":\"2026-07-31T10:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":123,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448590\",\"time\":\"2026-07-31T13:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"439\",\"seatsRemaining\":125,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"51 4k laser\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"448596\",\"time\":\"2026-07-31T15:20:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"441\",\"s